    "created_at": "2025-07-17T02:53:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-17T02:53:23Z",
    "body": "I am interested to see how a data attribute with the name `data-alt-origin` would fare if were applied in tests to massive websites or websites that read to standards and well in screen readers relative to many others. If I had more time Id do something like that run more tests to give the proposal a little boost. \n\nOtherwise I basically defer to everyone else here with more experience, just a comment suggesting more research could help this cause, its certainly interesting ",
