    "created_at": "2025-07-17T15:05:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-17T15:05:34Z",
    "body": "I don't think the danger is if an AI has been used to generate the alt text (or other content). The danger is if a human isn't in the loop. I think most authors cannot (or do not) write as good alt text as most AI these days. That goes for myself too. However, as an author, what matters is that I pay attention to the content that is being written, review it for accuracy, tone and focus. \n\nThe danger I think is those places where the author (or other human) isn't involved, and the bot focuses on the wrong thing, or hallucinates. \n\nTrust but verify. Always. ",
